            "In practice this means a PRINCE2 project baselines its plans and product descriptions as well as its time and cost targets, and uses tolerances set by the project board to decide when a forecast deviation must be escalated. We relied on a training provider's summary for the 7th edition wording; check the official PRINCE2 manual for exam use.",
